example {
  name: 400 Response
  description: '''
    Validation failed. `router_placeholder_route` means a BYOK save
    carried the `openRouter/auto` placeholder that this API shows in
    place of a managed profile's routes, and the tenant has no saved
    BYOK model to put in its place. When one is saved, the placeholder
    is replaced by that primary and its fallbacks instead.

  '''

